{
  "html": "\u003csection data-no-dark=\"\" id=\"cw-layout-magazine\" class=\"cw-reading-rhythm-v3\" style=\"background-color: #1c332c; box-sizing: border-box; color: #e7ead8; font-family: Georgia, \u0026#39;Songti SC\u0026#39;, SimSun, serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8; margin-left: 0; margin-right: 0; overflow-wrap: anywhere; padding: 26px 24px; width: 100%; word-break: break-word\"\u003e\u003csection style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: #e7ead8; margin: 0; margin-left: 0; margin-right: 0; max-width: 100%; padding: 0; width: 100%\"\u003e\u003csection style=\"background-image: url(\u0026#34;data:image/png;base64,\u0026#34;); background-position: right top; background-repeat: no-repeat; background-size: 160px 110px; border: 0; border-bottom: 1px solid #d1c780; box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0 0 26px; margin-left: 0; margin-right: 0; padding: 42px 20px 30px; width: 100%\"\u003e\u003cp style=\"background: transparent; border: 0; box-sizing: border-box; color: #e7ead8; display: block; font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.95; margin: 0; max-width: 100%; padding: 0; text-align: left; width: auto\"\u003e夜色落进深松林，木屋窗前亮起一盏暖琥珀小灯，把整篇文章裹进静谧的自然氛围里。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/section\u003e\u003csection style=\"background: transparent; border: 0; box-sizing: border-box; margin: 36px 0 0; margin-bottom: 0; margin-left: 0; margin-right: 0; padding: 18px 0 0; padding-bottom: 0; padding-top: 0; width: 100%\"\u003e\u003ch2 style=\"background: transparent; border: 0; color: #d1c780; display: block; font-family: Georgia, \u0026#39;Songti SC\u0026#39;, SimSun, serif; font-size: 24px; font-weight: 400; line-height: 1.5; margin: 0 0 16px; padding: 0 0 14px; text-align: left; text-indent: 0; width: auto\"\u003e深林底纹里的暖光阅读感\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp style=\"color: #e7ead8; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.95; margin: 0 0 18px\"\u003e松针深绿肌理背景配合柔和暖米正文与琥珀色重点，读起来沉静放松，独具辨识度。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cblockquote style=\"background-color: #2b493c; border: 0; border-radius: 30px 0 30px 0; color: #e7ead8; font-size: 21px; line-height: 1.9; margin: 24px 0; padding: 24px 20px; text-align: center\"\u003e\u003cp style=\"color: inherit; font-size: inherit; font-weight: inherit; line-height: inherit; margin: 0 0 12px\"\u003e离开城市信号半天，风声和树影会替你把思绪理顺。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/blockquote\u003e\u003cp style=\"box-sizing: border-box; line-height: 1.8; margin: 24px 0 0; text-align: left\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https://api.gitcode.com/api/v5/repos/wendao-ai/wendao-ai-template-market/raw/sample-images/botanical-leaves.jpg\" alt=\"晨光里的清绿枝叶与自然阴影\" style=\"display: block; height: auto; margin: 0; width: 100%\"/\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/section\u003e\u003csection style=\"background: transparent; border: 0; box-sizing: border-box; margin: 36px 0 0; margin-bottom: 0; margin-left: 0; margin-right: 0; padding: 18px 0 0; padding-bottom: 0; padding-top: 0; width: 100%\"\u003e\u003ch2 style=\"background: transparent; border: 0; color: #d1c780; display: block; font-family: Georgia, \u0026#39;Songti SC\u0026#39;, SimSun, serif; font-size: 24px; font-weight: 400; line-height: 1.5; margin: 0 0 16px; padding: 0 0 14px; text-align: left; text-indent: 0; width: auto\"\u003e适合林间风的图文方向\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cul style=\"margin: 0 0 16px; padding-left: 22px\"\u003e\u003cli style=\"margin: 0 0 8px; padding-left: 3px\"\u003e山野徒步、露营装备与旅宿分享\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli style=\"margin: 0 0 8px; padding-left: 3px\"\u003e自然观察、夜间电台与治愈独白\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli style=\"margin: 0 0 8px; padding-left: 3px\"\u003e深绿底纹与暖金文字对比舒适\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cp style=\"border: 0; border-top: 1px solid #b1c1a6; color: #e7ead8; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.95; margin: 32px 0 0; padding: 18px 0 0; text-align: left\"\u003e愿你在喧嚣之外，总有一盏林间灯火可归。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/section\u003e\u003c/section\u003e\u003c/section\u003e",
